{"sheets": [{"name": "Cheat sheet", "rows": [["Goods on Country: the model and the ask"], ["Working figures at 10 September 2026. All funding asks remain conditional."], [], ["Element", "Amount or measure", "What it means"], ["QBE plant ask", "=plants*plant_allowance", "Two proposed plants. Palm Island and Maningrida are working choices; site scope and quotes are still needed."], ["First-stock target", "=bed_target", "ALIVE and Alice Springs sit outside this target."], ["Bed price", "=price", "Factory-door price. Freight is charged separately at cost."], ["Itemised NM making calculation", "='One bed'!B11", "Modelled. Printed canon is $276. Wage allocation still needs reconciliation."], ["Contribution before overheads", "='One bed'!B13", "Applies when Goods receives the first-stock payment. Community resale proceeds stay with the community."], ["Beds covered if asks succeed", "=tff_beds+bmd_beds+snow_beds", "Tim Fairfax 133, Brian M. Davis 80, Snow 133."], ["Remaining whole beds", "=MAX(0,bed_target-tff_beds-bmd_beds-snow_beds)", "Conditional on all three asks succeeding."], ["Value of remaining whole beds", "=B11*price", "133 beds uses $99,750 of each $100,000 bed allocation. The two $250 balances remain unallocated."], ["Organisation running cost", "=running_cost", "Annual provision. Funding for future years and overlap with other cost lines need review."], ["Modelled beds per plant per year", "='Capacity'!B12", "Theoretical capacity at entered working days and throughput. Ramp timing and measured production remain separate."], ["Opening cash", "Unknown", "Ben and Eloise: enter a dated, reconciled bank position in Monthly cash B3."], ["What Goods pays", "Plants, first stock, agreed delivery and support", "Community operating costs require their own funding. Community resale is excluded from Goods receipts."], ["How to use the sheet", "Change one assumption and read the result", "Inputs changes bed economics and capacity. Monthly cash changes cash timing and amounts. Snapshot tabs retain the master baseline."], ["Weekly review", "Production, orders and funding", "Record stock counts and paid production hours. Update expected payment dates and outstanding quotes."], ["Monthly close", "Bank, ledger and forecast", "Enter reconciled receipts and payments. Compare cash actuals with the forecast; explain the variance and update remaining months."], ["Evidence still needed", "Opening balances, wage allocation, site costs", "Nic holds Q19. Eloise holds applicant cashflow and accounts. Historical activity does not establish future funding."], ["Funder wording", "QBE is being asked for $300,000 to build two community plants.", "Separate bed funding would pay Goods for the first stock. Communities keep the full proceeds when they sell those beds."], ["Before a spending decision", "Check cash availability and restrictions", "A grant application or possible loan cannot authorise a purchase. A loan also needs an evidenced repayment source."]], "widths": [290, 300, 540]}, {"name": "Read me", "rows": [["Goods on Country financial model", null], ["Working copy prepared 10 September 2026. AUD. Master cash figures recalculated in LibreOffice.", null], [null, null], ["How to use it", "Use Cheat sheet first. Edit yellow Inputs for bed economics. Edit yellow Monthly cash inputs for cash scenarios. Enter checked actuals separately."], ["What is different here", "Named inputs connect bed economics, capacity and the bed funding gap. Cases, Responsibilities, The year and Sites are dated master snapshots. They do not respond to Inputs."], ["What wins when two disagree", "canon.ts and asset-canonical.ts for figures. DECISIONS.md for judgements. CONTEXT.md for language. This workbook for money."], ["What is modelled, not measured", "The cost to make a bed, two hours of paid making, and 20 kg in a finished bed. The first fifty beds off each new plant replace all three with weighed and timed numbers."], ["What is verified", "Beds sold and paid, the register count, the FY26 ledger, the funder invitations and their dates."], ["What this does not hold", "Source provenance and accounting remain in the master. Monthly cash carries the 36-month cash baseline with editable cash amounts. There is no automatic Xero connection."], ["The one number that is zero", "The handoff records no secured funding for this raise. ALIVE receipts belong to earlier paid orders and sit outside the 400-bed target."], [null, null], ["Tab", "What it answers"], ["Inputs", "Every driver, in one place. The only tab you edit."], ["One bed", "What a bed is worth, what it costs, what stays, and how many carry the year."], ["The plant", "What a plant costs, module by module, and against what benchmarks."], ["Capacity", "How many beds a plant makes and which step sets the limit."], ["Impact", "The four areas, per bed and at volume, with where each claim stops."], ["Asks", "Every funder, the amount, the stage and the condition."], ["Cases", "Five scenarios and what each does to cash."], ["Responsibilities", "What Goods pays for and what the community pays for."], ["The year", "The annual roll-up."], ["Sites", "The three sites and their targets."], ["Claims", "Key figures with a grade and a source."]], "widths": [238, 440]}, {"name": "Inputs", "rows": [["Bed and production inputs", null, null, null, null], ["Yellow is yours. Each row has a name, and every other tab reads the name.", null, null, null, null], [null, null, null, null, null], ["Driver", "Value", "Unit", "Name used in formulas", "Where it comes from"], ["Bed price at the factory door", 750, "AUD", "price", "Model!B22. Ben's canon."], ["Plastic in a bed's cost", 60, "AUD", "cost_plastic", "NM Play B58, own-sheets route."], ["Electricity in a bed's cost", 16.67, "AUD", "cost_power", "NM Play B59."], ["Consumables in a bed's cost", 33.33, "AUD", "cost_consumables", "NM Play B60."], ["Bought parts in a bed's cost", 125.74, "AUD", "cost_parts", "NM Play B61. Poles 27, canvas 93.50, hardware 5.24."], ["Assembly allowance", 40, "AUD", "cost_assembly", "NM Play B64. This is the line that makes 235.74 into 276."], ["Paid making inside a bed", 80, "AUD", "wage_per_bed", "Two hours at the factory rate."], ["Hours of paid making a bed", 2, "hours", "hours_per_bed", "Settled 10 Sep. The 6.5-hour figure is withdrawn."], ["HDPE in a finished bed", 20, "kg", "kg_in_bed", "Design mass. NM Play B38."], ["Shred pressed to make a bed", 36, "kg", "kg_pressed", "Recorded production assumption: 21kg leg sheet plus 15kg tab sheet. NM Play B21 is 10kg net per sheet and is a different basis."], ["Freight a bed", 100, "AUD", "freight_per_bed", "Start!B49. Inherited estimate, routes need quotes."], ["Allowance for one plant", 150000, "AUD", "plant_allowance", "Capital!C7. Allowance pending site quotes."], ["Plants QBE builds", 2, "plants", "plants", "Ben, 9 Sep 2026."], ["Running the organisation a year", 297550, "AUD", "running_cost", "Model!B25."], ["Pressed sheets a day", 6, "sheets", "press_sheets_day", "NM Play B10. Unverified sustained rate."], ["Sheets pressed for one bed", 2, "sheets", "sheets_per_bed", "NM Play B45. One tab sheet, one leg sheet."], ["Production days a week", 5, "days", "days_per_week", "NM Play B7."], ["Productive weeks a year", 48, "weeks", "weeks_per_year", "NM Play B9."], ["Assembly ceiling", 5, "beds/day", "assembly_ceiling", "NM Play B36. Staffing has to verify it."], ["CNC throughput", 8.56, "beds/day", "cnc_rate", "NM Play B47. Never the constraint."], ["Bed target this year", 400, "beds", "bed_target", "Ben, 9 Sep 2026. First trading stock."], ["A plant's first year", 200, "beds", "first_year_per_plant", "Q6. First-year ramp target."], ["Tim Fairfax, beds", 133, "beds", "tff_beds", "$100,000 of the invited $300,000, at the bed price."], ["Brian M. Davis, beds", 80, "beds", "bmd_beds", "$60,000 of the invited $100,000."], ["Snow, beds", 133, "beds", "snow_beds", "Ben, 10 Sep: a $100,000 ask shaped like Brian M. Davis."], ["ALIVE, beds", 100, "beds", "alive_beds", "Already paid. Outside the target."], ["Community keeps, share of price", 1, "share", "community_keeps", "Ben, 10 Sep: the community keeps the full sale. The 50% split is retired."], ["Proposed loan", 200000, "AUD", "loan_amount", "Funding F06. Our number, not Sefa's."], ["Loan service a year", 47522.88, "AUD", "loan_service", "Cases!K6. 7% over five years."]], "widths": [238, 110, 110, 154, 434]}, {"name": "One bed", "rows": [["One bed", null, null], ["Never cost-plus. The price carries the business, and the organisation is never divided by beds alone.", null, null], [null, null, null], [null, "AUD", "Note"], ["Price at the factory door", "=price", "What a funder pays for a community's first stock."], ["Plastic", "=cost_plastic", null], ["Electricity", "=cost_power", null], ["Consumables", "=cost_consumables", null], ["Bought parts", "=cost_parts", "Poles, canvas, hardware."], ["Assembly allowance", "=cost_assembly", "The line that turns 235.74 into 276."], ["Cost to make", "=cost_plastic+cost_power+cost_consumables+cost_parts+cost_assembly", "Modelled until the first fifty come off the line at working pace."], ["Of which paid making", "=wage_per_bed", "Recorded wage assumption: $80. The itemised NM calculation has a $40 assembly line. Its wage allocation needs reconciliation before this is described as included."], ["Stays with Goods", "=price-(cost_plastic+cost_power+cost_consumables+cost_parts+cost_assembly)", "Carries Witta, the founders and the organisation."], ["Freight", "=freight_per_bed", "On top, at cost, per community, paid by whoever buys the bed."], [null, null, null], ["Running the organisation a year", "=running_cost", null], ["Beds a year that carry it, buyer pays freight", "=ROUNDUP(running_cost/(price-(cost_plastic+cost_power+cost_consumables+cost_parts+cost_assembly)),0)", "The break-even the deck prints."], ["Beds a year that carry it, Goods pays freight", "=ROUNDUP(running_cost/(price-(cost_plastic+cost_power+cost_consumables+cost_parts+cost_assembly)-freight_per_bed),0)", "What carrying freight costs in beds."], [null, null, null], ["Kept in the community on sale", "=price*community_keeps", "Ben, 10 Sep: the community keeps the full sale price."]], "widths": [280, 112, 434]}, {"name": "The plant", "rows": [["The plant, module by module", null, null, null, null, null], ["Thirteen modules and a site base. Four have a supplier price. Nine are estimates, and that is what the allowance margin is for.", null, null, null, null, null], [null, null, null, null, null, null], ["ID", "Module", "Low", "High", "Midpoint", "Price basis"], ["M01", "40ft shipping container", 13000, 16000, 14500, "Estimate or historical proxy"], ["M02", "20ft shipping container", 6000, 10000, 8000, "Estimate"], ["M03", "Diesel generator, press-line sized", 6600, 20000, 13300, "Estimate. The widest range of any module"], ["M04", "Crane placement and transport", 1200, 2500, 1850, "Quoted"], ["M05", "Electrical fit-out, board, three-phase", 3000, 8000, 5500, "Estimate"], ["M06", "Ventilation and fume extraction", 1000, 3000, 2000, "Estimate"], ["M07", "Site prep, pad and levelling", 500, 3000, 1750, "Estimate. Site specific"], ["M08", "PPE and startup consumables", 500, 1500, 1000, "Estimate"], ["M09", "Collection and sorting", 5000, 19500, 12250, "Estimate"], ["M10", "Shredding", 19800, 19800, 19800, "Telford Smith. A single price"], ["M11", "Pressing, CNC and finishing", 32780, 32780, 32780, "Circularity bundle. A single price"], ["M12", "Assembly and workshop", 6387, 6387, 6387, "Carbatec. A single price"], ["M13", "Sales and delivery", 0, 0, 0, "Nothing priced here yet"], [null, "Every module and the site base", "=SUM(C5:C17)", "=SUM(D5:D17)", "=SUM(E5:E17)", null], [null, null, null, null, null, null], [null, "Against the benchmarks", null, null, null, null], [null, "Replicate and install a site", 113000, null, null, "Capital!C31. The lean end."], [null, "The allowance we ask for", "=plant_allowance", null, null, "Sits above the module high."], [null, "Turnkey a site", 207450, null, null, "Capital!C32. Handed over running."], [null, "The QBE request", "=plants*plant_allowance", null, null, "Two plants."]], "widths": [110, 280, 110, 110, 110, 378]}, {"name": "Capacity", "rows": [["Capacity, and which step sets it", null, null], ["The lowest of pressing, CNC and assembly sets the modelled daily rate.", null, null], [null, null, null], ["Step", "Beds a day", "What it means"], ["Sort and shred", "=kg_pressed", "Kilograms of gross shred per bed."], ["Heat, press and cool", "=press_sheets_day/sheets_per_bed", "Six sheets a day, two sheets a bed. This sets the pace."], ["CNC cut and finish", "=cnc_rate", "CNC becomes the constraint if pressing and assembly both exceed this rate."], ["Assemble, test and pack", "=assembly_ceiling", "An independent ceiling that staffing has to verify."], [null, null, null], ["The binding step", "=MIN(press_sheets_day/sheets_per_bed,cnc_rate,assembly_ceiling)", "Whichever is lowest is the plant's real rate."], ["Beds a week", "=MIN(press_sheets_day/sheets_per_bed,cnc_rate,assembly_ceiling)*days_per_week", null], ["Beds a year", "=MIN(press_sheets_day/sheets_per_bed,cnc_rate,assembly_ceiling)*days_per_week*weeks_per_year", "The ceiling on the same equipment."], ["A plant's first year", "=first_year_per_plant", "The ramp we promise in Q6."], ["Both plants, first year", "=first_year_per_plant*plants", null], [null, null, null], ["Days to make the target", "=ROUNDUP(bed_target/MIN(press_sheets_day/sheets_per_bed,cnc_rate,assembly_ceiling),0)", "Before downtime, at the binding rate."], ["Shred needed for the target", "=bed_target*kg_pressed/1000", "Tonnes through the press."]], "widths": [280, 112, 434]}, {"name": "Impact", "rows": [["The four impact areas", null, null, null, null, null], ["Per bed, at one plant's first year and at the ceiling. Health is the reason the hardware exists and is never a claimed outcome.", null, null, null, null, null], [null, null, null, null, null, null], ["Area", "Unit", "Per bed", "At 200 beds", "At the ceiling", "Where the claim stops"], ["Recycling", "kg pressed", "=kg_pressed", "=kg_pressed*first_year_per_plant", "=kg_pressed*'Capacity'!B12", "Design mass is not measured diversion. Weigh feedstock, accepted parts, offcuts and waste per batch."], ["Recycling", "kg in the beds", "=kg_in_bed", "=kg_in_bed*first_year_per_plant", "=kg_in_bed*'Capacity'!B12", "The difference between the two rows is offcut or loss until yield is measured."], ["Health", "people off the floor", 1, "=first_year_per_plant", "='Capacity'!B12", "Scabies and rheumatic heart disease are why the hardware exists. No clinical outcome is claimed."], ["Employment", "hours of paid making", "=hours_per_bed", "=hours_per_bed*first_year_per_plant", "=hours_per_bed*'Capacity'!B12", "Report actual paid hours and payments. The legacy 4.8 hours a bed is comparison only."], ["Employment", "AUD of wage", "=wage_per_bed", "=wage_per_bed*first_year_per_plant", "=wage_per_bed*'Capacity'!B12", "Wage allocation against the itemised making calculation needs reconciliation."], ["Community enterprise", "AUD kept on sale", "=price*community_keeps", "=price*community_keeps*first_year_per_plant", "=price*community_keeps*'Capacity'!B12", "Only if the community sells the bed. Ownership is a pathway until rights and transfers are evidenced."]], "widths": [182, 182, 126, 126, 126, 364]}, {"name": "Asks", "rows": [["Every funder line", null, null, null, null, null], ["Funding stages are recorded from the handoff dated 10 September. Receipt evidence is required before money enters actuals.", null, null, null, null, null], [null, null, null, null, null, null], ["Funder", "Type", "Amount", "Beds it buys", "Stage", "Condition and next evidence"], ["QBE Foundation", "Grant", "=plants*plant_allowance", null, "Application", "Closes 25 Sep noon. Outcome 23 Oct. Pre-conditions 13 Nov. Builds plants, buys no beds."], ["Tim Fairfax Family Foundation", "Grant", 100000, "=tff_beds", "Invitation", "$300,000 over three years. Operating support, unrestricted. Due 9 Oct. Board late November."], ["Brian M. Davis Charitable Foundation", "Grant", 100000, "=bmd_beds", "Invitation", "Due 25 Sep. Board 19 Nov. Pays only once all project funding is confirmed, per the budget template B16."], ["Snow Foundation", "Grant", 100000, "=snow_beds", "To ask", "Ben, 10 September: proposed $100,000 request allocated to first stock. Historical Snow share remains unverified."], ["ALIVE, University of Melbourne", "Paid", 75000, "=alive_beds", "Received", "Already paid. Outside the target. The reckoning records more received than these beds."], ["Sefa Backing the Bold", "Loan", "=loan_amount", null, "Discussion", "No EOI sent. Our number, not Sefa's. 7% over five years."], ["Oonchiumpa, DEWR", "Grant", 150000, null, "Offer letter", "Alice Springs plant only, pass-through. Outside every scenario."], ["NIAA via Oonchiumpa", "Grant", 150000, null, "Discussion", "Alice Springs plant only, pass-through. Outside every scenario."], ["Dusseldorp", "Grant", 0, null, "Discussion", "No Goods ask in email. The $15,000 in June was CONTAINED."], ["Paul Ramsay and Atlassian", "Loan", 0, null, "Discussion", "Announced 7 Sep. No approach made."], ["Minderoo", "Grant", 0, null, "Closed", "Paused 14 May. Not a current prospect."], [null, null, null, null, null, null], ["Secured today", null, 0, null, null, "No signed commitment with a satisfied condition."], ["Beds covered if all three asks succeed", null, "=tff_beds+bmd_beds+snow_beds", null, null, "If every invited ask lands."], ["Beds still to find", null, "=MAX(0,bed_target-(tff_beds+bmd_beds+snow_beds))", null, null, null], ["Bed money still to find", null, "=MAX(0,bed_target-(tff_beds+bmd_beds+snow_beds))*price", null, null, null]], "widths": [266, 110, 112, 112, 112, 434]}, {"name": "Cases", "rows": [["Five cases", null, null, null, null, null, null, null], ["Master snapshot recalculated 10 September 2026. This tab does not recalculate when Inputs change. Use Monthly cash for cash scenarios.", null, null, null, null, null, null, null], [null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null], ["Case", "QBE", "Loan", "Beds", "Priced spend", "Receipts", "Peak cash need", "Interpretation"], ["Full", 300000, 200000, 400, 763084.33, 700000, 110607.21, "Capacity-constrained initial stock. Cases!A6."], ["Smaller, one plant", 150000, 100000, 400, 613084.33, 450000, 186845.77, "Stages capital, keeps the stock target. Peak need is higher than Full."], ["No QBE", 0, 200000, 400, 763084.33, 400000, 410607.21, "A stress test, not permission to spend unfunded money."], ["Receipts three months late", 300000, 200000, 400, 763084.33, 700000, 479488.63, "Same money, later. Peak need more than quadruples."], ["Half the Goods sales", 300000, 200000, 400, 763084.33, 700000, 110607.21, "Direct Goods sales are already zero, so halving them changes nothing."]], "widths": [182, 112, 112, 112, 112, 112, 112, 364]}, {"name": "Responsibilities", "rows": [["Who pays for what", null, null, null, null], ["Master snapshot recalculated 10 September 2026. This tab does not recalculate when Inputs change. Use Monthly cash for cash scenarios.", null, null, null, null], [null, null, null, null, null], ["Line", "Goods", "Community", "Combined", "Boundary"], ["Plant capital", 300000, 0, 300000, "The QBE request. Asset title and transfer to agree."], ["Making and freight", 125534.33, 0, 125534.33, "Capacity-constrained forecast."], ["Facility fixed costs", 35350, 420700, 456050, "Community facility wages, rent and training sit in the community operating plan."], ["Youth support", 40000, 0, 40000, "Four communities at $10,000 facilitation each. None named yet."], ["Shared network", 262200, 0, 262200, "Includes a known cost-overlap question."], ["Priced spending", 763084.33, 420700, 1183784.33, "Goods overheads are not automatically the incremental raise."]], "widths": [238, 126, 126, 126, 392]}, {"name": "The year", "rows":